# "Any number of target Equipment" includes none: Thorin targets itself and no Equipment (turn 3). Nothing becomes attached, so the
# reflexive ability never triggers: Bot1 is never asked for a target for it (the bare refusal) and Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity is
# undamaged. The scenario thorin-mountain-king-attaches-two-equipment-to-itself-and-deals-its-new-power is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
